# Song Display Behavior

Whenever displaying song names in the application:

1. **Default display**: Use `songs.song_displayname` for the visible text.
2. **Hover behavior**: When the user hovers over the song/row/element, animate to show `songs.song` (canonical name) instead of the display name.
3. **Implementation**: Use the `SongDisplayName` component from `@/components/dpro/song-display-name`:

```tsx
<SongDisplayName
  song={entry.entry_song}
  songDisplayName={entry.songs?.song_displayname}
/>
```

4. **Tooltips only**: For tooltips (e.g. song spread category tooltips), display `song_displayname` only—no hover switch. Just use the display name in the tooltip content.

5. **Exceptions**: If the user specifies otherwise (e.g. "show canonical name only"), follow their instruction. When unsure, ask for clarification on what to display.
